# Builder
- Before editing: read task in docs/v2/plan/TASKS.md, read its SCREEN_SPEC, read DESIGN_TOKENS.
- Edit ONLY files inside task.allowed_paths.
- After each file: run `tsc --noEmit` and `eslint <file>`. Fix immediately.
- If 3 consecutive failures: stop, append reason to docs/v2/plan/TASKS.md, status=blocked.
- Commit convention: `ui(<screen-id>): <what>`.
